      "summary": "PyInstaller 打包脚本：通过项目根的「前端控制台.spec」把 src/main.py 入口打包成无控制台黑框的单 exe，spec 内配置 excludes 排除 cryptography 等重依赖以加速启动。",
      "tags": ["build-system", "packaging", "pyinstaller", "script"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/build.py:build",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "build",
      "filePath": "src/build.py",
      "lineRange": [11, 32],
      "summary": "执行 PyInstaller 打包：图标缺失时跳过图标参数，按 spec 文件构建，成功后输出 dist/前端控制台.exe 的体积信息，失败提示未找到 exe。",
      "tags": ["build-system", "packaging", "entry-point"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/main.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "main.py",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "summary": "桌面应用入口：pywebview（WebView2）渲染前端 + 内嵌 Flask 后端（空闲端口），单实例互斥锁防重复启动（旧实例探活后聚焦窗口、死实例强制接管），支持 --mcp 模式作为 MCP stdio server 运行；窗口关闭时清理串口、endpoint 文件与 WebView2 缓存，并实现 server/webview 并行预导入等启动加速。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "desktop-app", "pywebview", "single-instance", "startup-optimization"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "大量 Windows 原生 API 使用：ctypes CreateMutexW 实现单实例锁、EnumWindows 遍历窗口聚焦旧实例、GlobalLock 读剪贴板绕过 WebView2 权限弹窗——句柄均为 64 位指针，ctypes 需显式声明 argtypes/restype 否则按 c_int 截断溢出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:acquire_single_instance",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "acquire_single_instance",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [23, 30],
      "summary": "通过 Win32 CreateMutexW 创建全局命名互斥体实现单实例；GetLastError 返回 183（ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS）说明已有实例，返回 False。",
      "tags": ["single-instance", "win32", "mutex"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:find_and_focus_existing_window",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "find_and_focus_existing_window",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [91, 130],
      "summary": "EnumWindows 遍历所有可见窗口，按标题匹配「前端控制台 v1.0.0」找到已运行实例的窗口，最小化态先 SW_RESTORE 恢复再 SetForegroundWindow 置前；ctypes 显式声明全部 API 的参数与返回类型防 64 位句柄截断。",
      "tags": ["win32", "window-management", "single-instance"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:write_endpoint",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "write_endpoint",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [44, 58],
      "summary": "把本地 Flask 服务的地址（url/port/pid/启动时间）写入 ~/.serialconsole_pro/endpoint.json，供 Claude Code MCP server 与 serial_cli 跨会话发现后端。失败静默。",
      "tags": ["service-discovery", "serialization", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:_clean_webview_cache",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_clean_webview_cache",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [69, 88],
      "summary": "关闭时删除 WebView2 纯缓存子树（HTTP Cache/Code Cache/GPU Shader/组件更新包），保留 Local Storage/Cookies/IndexedDB 等用户状态；删失败静默，下次启动自动重建。",
      "tags": ["cache-management", "cleanup", "webview"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:_old_instance_alive",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_old_instance_alive",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [133, 147],
      "summary": "读 endpoint.json 并对 /api/status 发起 1.5s 探活，判断旧实例是真活着还是 mutex 残留的僵尸，决定聚焦退出还是强制接管。",
      "tags": ["single-instance", "health-check", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:_run_mcp_mode",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_run_mcp_mode",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [150, 162],
      "summary": "--mcp 模式入口：PyInstaller --windowed 下 sys.stdin/stdout 可能为 None，用 fd 0/1 重新包装后延迟导入 src.mcp_server 并运行其主循环，避免 GUI 模式加载 MCP 依赖。",
      "tags": ["mcp", "stdio", "entry-point", "lazy-loading"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/main.py:main",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "main",
      "filePath": "src/main.py",
      "lineRange": [165, 410],
      "summary": "主启动流程：--mcp 分流到 MCP 模式；单实例检查（活实例聚焦退出/死实例接管重取锁）；后台线程预导入 server 模块与主线程 import webview 并行；随机空闲端口起 Flask 并轮询就绪后才写 endpoint；注册 FileBridge JS API（原生文件/目录选择对话框、Win32 读剪贴板）、窗口关闭回调（清串口/endpoint/缓存）、原生拖拽 drop 分发（文本进编辑器、日志进查看器），并把旧版 WebView2 缓存目录迁移到数据目录后以非隐私模式启动。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "desktop-app", "startup-optimization", "event-handler"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/mcp_server.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "mcp_server.py",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "summary": "MCP stdio server（纯标准库实现 JSON-RPC，不依赖 mcp SDK）：让 Claude Code 原生集成前端控制台能力——observe/list_ports/connect/send_command/send_raw/send_burst 等串口 SSH 操作，read_log/search_log/diff_logs 日志分析，及 TFTP 服务控制；通过 ~/.serialconsole_pro/endpoint.json 发现后端，未运行时自动拉起（源码 pythonw 优先、exe 后备），stdin/stdout 统一重配 UTF-8 防 GBK 编码炸非 GBK 字符。",
      "tags": ["mcp", "stdio-server", "json-rpc", "service-discovery", "api-client"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "手写最小化 JSON-RPC 实现（initialize/tools/list/tools/call 三方法），并内置 16 个工具 schema；后端地址缓存 + URLError 时失效重发现的懒发现模式；每次调用后向 /api/ai/mcp_report 上报供前端状态面板展示。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:_ensure_backend",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_ensure_backend",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [86, 125],
      "summary": "确保工具后端在跑：endpoint 存在且探活通过直接返回；否则按候选优先级（frozen exe 自身、src/main.py 源码 pythonw、dist exe、桌面 exe、run.bat）无黑框拉起，轮询最多 25s 等就绪。",
      "tags": ["service-discovery", "auto-start", "process-management"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:tool_observe",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "tool_observe",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [177, 208],
      "summary": "MCP 概览工具：调 /api/ai/observe 汇总所有已连接串口/SSH 的状态（波特率、缓冲行数、最近输出）与前端已打开的日志列表，格式化为易读文本，是 AI 了解当前状态的首要入口。",
      "tags": ["mcp-tool", "api-client", "status"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:tool_send_burst",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "tool_send_burst",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [273, 290],
      "summary": "数据连发工具：把整条时间线（每步延时+命令/原始字节+收输出）原子提交后端执行，用于 AI 掐不准时间窗口的场景（如 reboot 后 3s 内连发 Ctrl-U 停进 uboot）；HTTP 超时按总时长动态放大，部分失败也展示已执行步骤。",
      "tags": ["mcp-tool", "api-client", "automation"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:tool_diff_logs",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "tool_diff_logs",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [376, 425],
      "summary": "日志对比工具（BSP 排查「正常启动 vs 异常启动」）：summary 模式输出只在某份出现的行与频次差异（按次数排序），line 模式输出带上下文的增/减/变化块，结果格式化为带行号与统计头的文本。",
      "tags": ["mcp-tool", "log-analysis", "diff"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:_dispatch",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "_dispatch",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [697, 740],
      "summary": "工具调用分发器：按 name 把 MCP tools/call 的参数路由到对应 tool_* 函数，缺必填参数时抛出带字段名的 ValueError 提示（而非裸 KeyError），未知工具返回提示文本。",
      "tags": ["mcp", "dispatcher", "validation"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/mcp_server.py:main",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "main",
      "filePath": "src/mcp_server.py",
      "lineRange": [754, 843],
      "summary": "MCP stdio 主循环：stdin/stdout/stderr 重配 UTF-8；逐行读 JSON-RPC 处理 initialize（协议版本 2024-11-05）/tools/list/tools/call；后端地址懒发现+缓存，URLError 时失效缓存重新发现并重试一次；每次调用后向 /api/ai/mcp_report 上报记录供前端 MCP 状态面板展示。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "mcp", "json-rpc", "event-loop"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/serial_cli.py",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "serial_cli.py",
      "filePath": "src/serial_cli.py",
      "summary": "命令行直连桥：让任何终端一键发现并操作运行中的工具后端——overview/status/ports/buf/recent/send/raw/watch 等子命令通过 HTTP API 实时查看与发送串口数据；工具未运行时按 run.bat/exe 候选自动拉起并等就绪，--no-start 可做纯检测。",
      "tags": ["cli", "api-client", "service-discovery", "utility"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/serial_cli.py:find_endpoint",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "find_endpoint",
      "filePath": "src/serial_cli.py",
      "lineRange": [34, 51],
      "summary": "读 ~/.serialconsole_pro/endpoint.json 拿到后端地址，并实时探活 /api/status 验证服务仍活着（进程可能已退出但文件残留），返回 (url, info) 或 (None, None)。",
      "tags": ["service-discovery", "health-check", "utility"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/serial_cli.py:ensure_running",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "ensure_running",
      "filePath": "src/serial_cli.py",
      "lineRange": [60, 102],
      "summary": "确保工具后端在运行：未运行时优先用 run.bat 启动源码版（DETACHED_PROCESS 不阻塞），否则用 exe 候选；轮询 endpoint 出现且服务就绪（默认最多 25s），返回 url 或 None。",
      "tags": ["auto-start", "process-management", "service-discovery"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/serial_cli.py:cmd_watch",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "cmd_watch",
      "filePath": "src/serial_cli.py",
      "lineRange": [219, 240],
      "summary": "实时跟随模式：0.5s 轮询 /api/ai/observe，按每行 ts 去重只打印新增行（先用当前缓冲初始化 seen 防一上来刷屏），Ctrl-C 退出。",
      "tags": ["cli", "polling", "realtime"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:src/serial_cli.py:main",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "main",
      "filePath": "src/serial_cli.py",
      "lineRange": [242, 279],
      "summary": "CLI 入口：解析子命令（--no-start 纯检测不自动启动；默认 ensure_running 自动拉起），分发 overview/status/ports/buf/recent/send/raw/watch/start 到对应 cmd_* 函数，未知命令打印用法文档。",
      "tags": ["entry-point", "cli", "dispatcher"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    }
